{"message":"成功","data":{"datas":[{"id":7030,"title":"非洲<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>国家议员研讨班一行来洛访问","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-04-26 08:50:45","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-04-26 08:50:45","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"今日洛阳","source":"洛阳日报","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/04-26/7030.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":7030,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10978062","content":"<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">24日至25日，来自博茨瓦纳、莱索托、马拉维、纳米比亚、塞舌尔、索马里、乌干达、赞比亚等8个国家的非洲<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>国家议员研讨班一行来洛访问考察","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"非洲<span style=\"color:red\">英</span><span style=\"color:red\">语</span>国家议员研讨班一行来洛访问","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":62184,"title":"洛阳市老促会会长刘湖镜到洛宁调研“泉项目”实施情况","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-03-03 09:12:18","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-03-03 09:12:18","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"洛宁县","source":"洛宁县人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/03-03/62184.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":62184,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10974819","content":"</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">据介绍，“泉项目”是上海泉爱公益基金会捐助发起的“泉•音乐和<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>项目”，在乡村地区开展音乐和<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>公益助学, 该项目2016年进驻我县赵村镇西王村中学等学校，每年选派2-3名音乐和<span style=\"color:red\">英语专业</span>的在校大学生到我县支教，并且捐赠音乐器材及设备。项目开展以来，我县累计有数万名学生从中受益。","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"洛阳市老促会会长刘湖镜到洛宁调研“泉项目”实施情况","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":59125,"title":"市老促会会长刘湖镜带队到伊川调研","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-03-06 17:47:34","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-03-06 17:47:34","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"伊川县","source":"伊川县人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/03-06/59125.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":59125,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10974963","content":"</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">“泉项目”是上海普洛斯泉爱公益基金会捐助发起的项目，在农村中小学开展音乐和<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>公益助学，旨在增强农村学生的创造力, 该项目实施以来，已经陆续给吕店镇第一初级中学西校区、吕店镇第一初级中学东校区、丁流小学、下范小学、温沟小学、王村小学等六所学校捐赠了音乐器材，派驻了支教老师，学生们通过学习音乐、<span style=\"color:red\">英语口语</span>、小鼓、小号等，","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"市老促会会长刘湖镜带队到伊川调研","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":45531,"title":"西工区六所学校实现智慧教育基础设施全覆盖","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-03-22 10:20:43","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-03-22 10:20:43","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"西工区","source":"西工区人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/03-22/45531.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":45531,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10975731","content":"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">打开智慧黑板、轻点鼠标，仅需数秒，就把近千公里外的一位北京名师“请”进了教室……日前，在西工区唐宫路小学三年级（1）班，一堂精彩的<span style=\"color:red\">英语口语</span>互动课正在开讲, 该班<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>教师吴老师说，学生们学得认真，她也不敢怠慢，“得抓住机会给自己‘充充电’”。","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"西工区六所学校实现智慧教育基础设施全覆盖","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":49257,"title":"瀍河回族区又添一所名校 助推教育高质量发展","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-01-09 09:17:48","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-01-09 09:17:48","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"瀍河回族区","source":"瀍河回族区人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/01-09/49257.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":49257,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10972392","content":"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">新年伊始，瀍河区委区政府与洛阳外国语学校成功携手开展合作办学，将位于中州东路与史家街交叉口西北角的新建学校命名为洛阳外国语学校附属小学，突出<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>及小语种教学, 新建的附属小学除开设<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>外，还将开设日语、俄语、德语、西班牙语等其他小语种课程学习，充分利用外国语学校资源，发挥少年儿童小学阶段语言吸收能力快、思维发散的优势，帮助学生提前学习掌握外语基础知识，提升视野","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"瀍河回族区又添一所名校 助推教育高质量发展","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":72449,"title":"洛阳书生教育集团首届全学科阅读论坛暨会在伊滨区第一实验小学隆重举行","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-03-27 11:43:28","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-03-27 11:43:28","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"洛阳经济技术开发区","source":"洛阳伊滨经济技术开发区","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/03-27/72449.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":72449,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10976042","content":"/p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">“全科阅读”即“全学科阅读”，要求师生超越阅读只属于语文学科的狭窄观念，将阅读范围扩大至语文、数学、<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"洛阳书生教育集团首届全学科阅读论坛暨会在伊滨区第一实验小学隆重举行","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":41485,"title":"洛阳市审计局召开“审计，40，正青春” 主题青年干部交流座谈会","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-04-26 11:58:27","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-04-26 11:58:27","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"部门动态","source":"市审计局","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/04-26/41485.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":41485,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10978110","content":"</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">会议邀请了省十三届青联委员、一路向南<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>工作室主理人李睿，市财政局人事科科长周晓，市财政绩效评价中心主任刘捷等三位嘉宾，结合个人经历与青年干部深入交流","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"洛阳市审计局召开“审计，40，正青春” 主题青年干部交流座谈会","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":41858,"title":"第一届“洛阳建龙杯”大学生外贸达人赛决赛成功举办","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-06-07 17:22:42","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-06-07 17:22:42","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"部门动态","source":"市商务局","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/06-07/41858.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":41858,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10980276","content":"/p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">在抽签确定表演顺序后，参赛选手以电商直播、商务谈判等丰富多彩的形式对自行选择的任意一款我市出口产品用<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>进行了推介表演","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"第一届“洛阳建龙杯”大学生外贸达人赛决赛成功举办","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":44556,"title":"涧西区政协开展教师节走访慰问活动","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-09-08 11:32:24","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-09-08 11:32:24","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"涧西区","source":"涧西区人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/09-08/44556.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":44556,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10985431","content":"</p><p>　　政协委员们先后来到东升一小、行知实验学校、大所学校、区<span style=\"color:red\">英语学校</span>、厂北小学、天津路小学、联盟路初级中学等地，实地走访察看了各个学校的校园环境、基础设施建设情况，认真听取各学校关于集团化办学","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"涧西区政协开展教师节走访慰问活动","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":44246,"title":"洛阳唯一 涧西区首批入选！","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-01-06 11:36:46","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-01-06 11:36:46","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"涧西区","source":"涧西区人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/01-06/44246.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":44246,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10972335","content":"《河南省教育厅关于开展首批“五育”并举实验区和实验学校建设工作的通知》等文件精神，经过单位（学校）申请、市县推荐、省级评审、网上公示等环节，涧西区荣获首批河南省“五育”并举实验区，涧西区东升第二中学、<span style=\"color:red\">英语学校</span>荣获首批河南省","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"洛阳唯一 涧西区首批入选！","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":42068,"title":"洛阳选手在2023年度河南省科普讲解大赛暨全国科普讲解大赛选拔赛决赛斩获佳绩","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-06-26 14:13:40","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-06-26 14:13:40","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"部门动态","source":"市科学技术局","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/06-26/42068.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":42068,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10981447","content":"经过激烈角逐，青少年组洛阳市第二外国语学校涧西小学许桐、洛阳市西工区外国语小学刘怡萱分别荣获省青少年组第一名、第二名好成绩，荣获金奖；洛阳市涧西区<span style=\"color:red\">英语学校</span>何路得、洛阳市涧西区景华实验小学牛之谦荣获省青少年组三等奖","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"洛阳选手在2023年度河南省科普讲解大赛暨全国科普讲解大赛选拔赛决赛斩获佳绩","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":45550,"title":"全省唯一！西工区喜获“全国信息技术支撑学生综合素质评价试点区”","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-04-14 09:22:35","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-04-14 09:22:35","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"西工区","source":"西工区人民政府","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/04-14/45550.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":45550,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10977088","content":"依据学生核心素养发展理念，发挥智慧工具优势，建设大阅读、数学实体化、<span style=\"color:red\">英语</span>童话剧、思政讨论等10个学科主题融合数字化课程。","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"全省唯一！西工区喜获“全国信息技术支撑学生综合素质评价试点区”","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0},{"id":7037,"title":"工运之星耀河洛 立足岗位建新功","subtitle":"","summary":"","createDate":"2023-04-27 08:36:56","writeDate":null,"pubDate":"2023-04-27 08:36:56","type":10,"newsWeigh":0,"siteId":"4103000021","channelName":"今日洛阳","source":"洛阳日报","author":"","keyword":"","outUrl":"","selfUrl":"https://www.ly.gov.cn/2023/04-27/7037.html","focusPic1":"","focusPic2":"","focusPic3":"","seq":7037,"reNum":"","openType":0,"themeClass":0,"themeClassName":"","docType":0,"docTypeName":"","docNum":"","docAgency":"","moreAudit":0,"clone":0,"videoUrl":"","depName":"","bulletinTotal":0,"bulletinYear":0,"bulletinNum":0,"str0":"","str1":"","str2":"","str3":"","str4":"","str5":"","str6":"","str7":"","str8":"","str9":"10978121","content":"text-align: left;\">焦正林 中实洛阳重型机械有限公司清理班班长</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: left;\">黄 艳（女）洛阳市涧西区<span style=\"color:red\">英语学校</span>党支部书记","contentStr":"","matchTitle":"工运之星耀河洛 立足岗位建新功","detailType":0,"reportSiteId":"","disableFlag":0}],"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":15,"totalPage":1,"totalRow":13},"code":1}